<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>人大经济学“天选导师”匹配测试</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #222;
      --muted: #666;
      --line: #e6e8eb;
      --soft: #f7f8fa;
      --accent: #8d1b24;
      --accent-dark: #601018;
      --gold: #b5822b;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 22px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 680px;
      padding: 16px 0 48px;
    }

    .topline {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.65rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .intro {
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      max-width: 560px;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
    }

    .form-group { margin-bottom: 22px; }

    label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.03rem;
    }

    select,
    input[type="text"] {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 48px;
      border: 1px solid #cfd4da;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 11px 13px;
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 1rem;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.18s, box-shadow 0.18s;
    }

    select:focus,
    input[type="text"]:focus {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(141, 27, 36, 0.12);
    }

    input[type="text"] { text-transform: uppercase; }

    .error-msg {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 6px;
      color: #b00020;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .btn {
      min-height: 46px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 11px 24px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.16s, opacity 0.16s, background 0.16s;
    }

    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }

    .btn-primary {
      display: block;
      margin: 34px auto 0;
      min-width: 160px;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }

    .btn-light {
      background: #eef0f3;
      color: #2d3035;
    }

    .btn-light:hover { background: #e1e4e8; }

    #quiz-screen,
    #result-screen { display: none; }

    .progress-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .progress-track {
      flex: 1;
      height: 7px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #edf0f2;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      width: 0;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--accent);
      transition: width 0.22s;
    }

    .question-text {
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      font-size: 1.22rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .option-btn {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 58px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 15px 17px;
      background: var(--soft);
      color: var(--ink);
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.16s, border-color 0.16s, transform 0.16s;
    }

    .option-btn:hover {
      background: #fff;
      border-color: #bfc6cf;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .result-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .result-header h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 1.55rem;
    }

    .result-type {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .metaphysics-text {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 15px;
      background: var(--soft);
      color: #555;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
    }

    .teacher-card {
      border: 2px solid var(--ink);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .t-name {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: 2rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .t-fields {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      color: #555;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .t-desc {
      color: #333;
      font-size: 1.03rem;
    }

    .ranking-section {
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .ranking-section h3 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 1.12rem;
    }

    .ranking-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .ranking-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 14px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f1f3;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }

    .ranking-item:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .rank-name { font-weight: 700; }
    .rank-score { color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; }

    .score-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 26px;
    }

    .score-chip {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 9px 7px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .score-chip strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .score-chip span {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .btn-group {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 34px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .credit {
      margin: 34px auto 0;
      max-width: 560px;
      color: #888;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }

    .credit a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .credit a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      body { padding: 18px; }
      h1 { font-size: 1.42rem; }
      .teacher-card { padding: 20px; }
      .t-name { font-size: 1.68rem; }
      .score-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .ranking-item { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2px; }
      .rank-score { white-space: normal; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="container">
    <div id="form-screen">
      <div class="topline">RUC ECON MENTOR TEST</div>
      <h1>人大经济学“天选导师”匹配测试</h1>
      <p class="intro">请凭第一直觉作答。系统会读取你的研究气质，并生成一份命定导师排行榜。</p>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="input-zodiac">你的星座</label>
        <select id="input-zodiac">
          <option value="白羊座">白羊座 (Aries)</option>
          <option value="金牛座">金牛座 (Taurus)</option>
          <option value="双子座">双子座 (Gemini)</option>
          <option value="巨蟹座">巨蟹座 (Cancer)</option>
          <option value="狮子座">狮子座 (Leo)</option>
          <option value="处女座">处女座 (Virgo)</option>
          <option value="天秤座">天秤座 (Libra)</option>
          <option value="天蝎座">天蝎座 (Scorpio)</option>
          <option value="射手座">射手座 (Sagittarius)</option>
          <option value="摩羯座">摩羯座 (Capricorn)</option>
          <option value="水瓶座">水瓶座 (Aquarius)</option>
          <option value="双鱼座">双鱼座 (Pisces)</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="input-mbti">你的 MBTI</label>
        <input type="text" id="input-mbti" placeholder="例如 INFP" maxlength="4" autocomplete="off">
        <div id="mbti-error" class="error-msg">请输入 4 位 MBTI 字母，例如 INFP。</div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="input-blood">你的血型</label>
        <select id="input-blood">
          <option value="A型">A</option>
          <option value="B型">B</option>
          <option value="AB型">AB</option>
          <option value="O型">O</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="input-bazi">你的八字日主</label>
        <select id="input-bazi">
          <option value="甲木">甲木</option>
          <option value="乙木">乙木</option>
          <option value="丙火">丙火</option>
          <option value="丁火">丁火</option>
          <option value="戊土">戊土</option>
          <option value="己土">己土</option>
          <option value="庚金">庚金</option>
          <option value="辛金">辛金</option>
          <option value="壬水">壬水</option>
          <option value="癸水">癸水</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="startQuiz()">开始匹配</button>
    </div>

    <div id="quiz-screen">
      <div class="progress-row">
        <span>进度：<span id="quiz-progress">1 / 15</span></span>
        <div class="progress-track" aria-hidden="true">
          <div id="progress-fill" class="progress-fill"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="question-text" class="question-text">问题加载中...</div>
      <div id="options-container"></div>
    </div>

    <div id="result-screen">
      <div class="result-header">
        <h2>命定导师匹配报告</h2>
        <div>你的研究气质偏向：<span id="result-type" class="result-type">生成中</span></div>
      </div>

      <div id="metaphysics-insight" class="metaphysics-text">生成中...</div>

      <section class="teacher-card">
        <h3 id="res-name" class="t-name">导师姓名</h3>
        <div id="res-fields" class="t-fields">代表方向</div>
        <div id="res-desc" class="t-desc">导师评语</div>
      </section>

      <section class="ranking-section">
        <h3>匹配度排行榜</h3>
        <ul id="ranking-list" class="ranking-list"></ul>
      </section>

      <section class="score-grid" id="score-grid" aria-label="研究气质分布"></section>

      <div class="btn-group">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="location.reload()">重新测试</button>
        <button class="btn btn-light" onclick="shareResult()">分享结果</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="credit">
      本测试题设计参考了
      <a href="https://celanaventine.github.io/ruc-mentor-test/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">人大社院“天选导师”匹配测试</a>
      的互动形式。
    </p>
  </main>

